          "items": [
            "GREAT DATES ARE AVAILABLE! PLAN YOU ESCAPE TO THIS SWEET COTTAGE: May 18-22<br><br> \"Loved by guests\"..... Perfect cottage in the perfect location - plan you vacay - booking now for 2026 - weeks are still available! Plan your escape at Escape Plan 30b - don't miss out on fabulous weather and the best sunsets. Check out this adorable new build Old Seagrove cottage! ALL 5 star reviews! Plan your vacay today. Don't miss out on this escape. Reserving weeks for 2026!<br> <br>Book now for amazing sunsets, nature walks, suntans, yummy food, fun shopping and heated cocktail pool! Book now for 2025! Great home for families and girl's trips. Walking distance to Seaside and the Beach!!! Relaxing in heated cocktail pool. Don't miss out on this escape.<br><br> Brand new, custom built cottage, with adorable heated cocktail pool already has 5 star reviews!!! Located in the sweet area of Old Seagrove on a sandy road, this cottage is minutes away from the beach, Seaside and Watercolor. This charming 3 bedroom/ 2 bath cottage sleeps 8. Offering approximately 1300 square feet of comfortable living space - the large living room is perfect for movies and games. The modern kitchen and island, which seats 5-8, are ideal for fun family mealtimes and cocktails. The bedrooms have beautiful, peaceful, and relaxing decor - all are equipped with smart TVs. A large screened in back porch, with fun bed swing and eating area, overlooks the private, fenced back yard and entertaining cocktail pool - which can be heated in the winter months. Nature is abundant in the area, so don't be surprised to sea big squirrels, deer, bunnies, foxes and maybe a raccoon. A grill is provided for your outdoor cooking skills. All linens, towels and beach towels are provided.<br><br>This cottage is just 3 blocks from 30A and a short bike ride or walk to the beach, Seaside, and Watercolor. Local dining options are: Great Southern Kitchen, Bud and Alleys, Day Trader, Fish out of Water (FOOW), Wine World, as well as Black Bear Bakery and more. The Red Bar, GracePizza30A and Cafe30A are just a few miles away. Publix and Modica Market are close, so you can easily supply your kitchen needs.<br><br>Bikes and golf carts can conveniently be delivered and picked up from this location.<br><br>Two week maximum<br>Tankless hotwater heater gives you unlimited hot water!<br>Non smoking rental<br>Parking for 2/3 cars plus golf cart!<br>I have recommendations for: bike rentals, beach chairs and baby gear.<br>ADDITIONAL FEE: Two hundred and forty dollar cleaning fee left at departure - can be cash or check.<br>Rental agreement sent after booking - must be signed prior to arrival.<br>Ring door bell camera at front door.",
